# Mosquitto ACL Template for FARMLINK Platform
#
# Topic substitution details:
# - %u: Replaced by Mosquitto with the client's authenticated username.
# - For devices, the MQTT username is the device_id (UUID), restricting each device
#   to its dedicated topic prefix (farmlink/v2/<device_id>/...).
# - The backend API connects as the user 'farmlink-api' to observe telemetry/events
#   and issue signed control commands.
#
# To apply, generate or copy this file to the Mosquitto acl_file location (/mosquitto/config/acl).

# Backend API permissions
user farmlink-api
topic read farmlink/v2/+/readings
topic read farmlink/v2/+/status
topic read farmlink/v2/+/events
topic read farmlink/v2/+/ack
topic write farmlink/v2/+/cmd

# Per-device permissions (%u = authenticated device_id username)
pattern write farmlink/v2/%u/readings
pattern write farmlink/v2/%u/status
pattern write farmlink/v2/%u/events
pattern write farmlink/v2/%u/ack
pattern read farmlink/v2/%u/cmd
